{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 2, "text": "灵牌，桌旁放着灵房。舅家请来的两位长者端坐桌后，充当“大老爷”，负责坐镇监督。砍", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 241, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "灵牌，桌旁放着灵房。舅家请来的两位长者端坐桌后，充当“大老爷”，负责坐镇监督。砍", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 241, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 3, "text": "牛的女婿家在这里有事均需请示他们，征得他们同意后才能行事。转场时每个人来到他", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 306, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "牛的女婿家在这里有事均需请示他们，征得他们同意后才能行事。转场时每个人来到他", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 306, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 4, "text": "们面前均得下跪磕一个头。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 374, "w": 474, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "们面前均得下跪磕一个头。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 374, "w": 474, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 5, "text": "如果家庭经济困难，可以不举行超度仪式，只请布摩举行简单的“开路”仪式即可。", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 435, "w": 1471, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "如果家庭经济困难，可以不举行超度仪式，只请布摩举行简单的“开路”仪式即可。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 435, "w": 1471, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 6, "text": "以后遇到另外的亲人亡故，而家庭经济又宽裕，才一并超度，这类亡灵称“冷鬼”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 503, "w": 1395, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "以后遇到另外的亲人亡故，而家庭经济又宽裕，才一并超度，这类亡灵称“冷鬼”。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 503, "w": 1395, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 7, "text": "死者外家和女婿家吊丧时，要扛上染成各种色的皮纸、竹篾扎成纸旗、纸幡、纸伞和", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 567, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "死者外家和女婿家吊丧时，要扛上染成各种色的皮纸、竹篾扎成纸旗、纸幡、纸伞和", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 567, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 8, "text": "灵房等。这些祭吊品均为剪纸作品，图案丰富，工艺精细，色彩斑斓，是很有特色的工艺", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 632, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "灵房等。这些祭吊品均为剪纸作品，图案丰富，工艺精细，色彩斑斓，是很有特色的工艺", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 632, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 9, "text": "品。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 700, "w": 64, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "品。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 700, "w": 64, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 10, "text": "葬后，有些人家立即立石碑，也有的第三年才立。有的家庭经济困难的也可以不立", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 764, "w": 1459, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "葬后，有些人家立即立石碑，也有的第三年才立。有的家庭经济困难的也可以不立", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 764, "w": 1459, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 11, "text": "石碑。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 829, "w": 105, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "石碑。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 829, "w": 105, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 12, "text": "布依族也有“回煞”的信仰。六盘水一带，第三天丧家请布摩来诵经。死者女儿做糯", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 885, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族也有“回煞”的信仰。六盘水一带，第三天丧家请布摩来诵经。死者女儿做糯", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 885, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 13, "text": "米饭及菜肴来供祭。丧家把屋子打扫干净，撒上麦灰，神龛上供上祭品。布摩诵完经，全", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 954, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "米饭及菜肴来供祭。丧家把屋子打扫干净，撒上麦灰，神龛上供上祭品。布摩诵完经，全", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 954, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 14, "text": "家即外出躲避，过一会儿才开门回家，看地上有无脚印，以判断亡人是否回来。在一些地", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1022, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家即外出躲避，过一会儿才开门回家，看地上有无脚印，以判断亡人是否回来。在一些地", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1022, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 15, "text": "区，如果第二天早上发现有动物脚印，即认为是亡灵变成这种动物回家来过。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1082, "w": 1331, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "区，如果第二天早上发现有动物脚印，即认为是亡灵变成这种动物回家来过。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1082, "w": 1331, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 16, "text": "此外，在立幡仪式上，有一个细节是由布摩和家族长者呼喊死者祖先迁徙经过的地", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1151, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此外，在立幡仪式上，有一个细节是由布摩和家族长者呼喊死者祖先迁徙经过的地", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1151, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 17, "text": "名，其用途在于使亡灵知道返回祖宗居住地的路线。这对研究布依族的历史具有重要的", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1215, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "名，其用途在于使亡灵知道返回祖宗居住地的路线。这对研究布依族的历史具有重要的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1215, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 18, "text": "价值。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1283, "w": 105, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "价值。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1283, "w": 105, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 19, "text": "三、信仰与禁忌", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1346, "w": 262, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "三、信仰与禁忌", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1346, "w": 262, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 20, "text": "布依族认为人死后灵魂不灭。亡灵通过布摩举行超度仪式进入祖先亡灵驻地“旁", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1408, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族认为人死后灵魂不灭。亡灵通过布摩举行超度仪式进入祖先亡灵驻地“旁", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1408, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 21, "text": "，“旁拜”。那里是布依族摩教信仰中的极乐世界。在“旁仙”、“旁拜”，亡灵虽然仍与", "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1468, "w": 1487, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "，“旁拜”。那里是布依族摩教信仰中的极乐世界。在“旁仙”、“旁拜”，亡灵虽然仍与", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 185, "y": 1468, "w": 1487, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 22, "text": "在阳世一样，要劳动、社交、恋爱、婚嫁，但在那里他们已经上升成上流社会成员，成“报", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1541, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在阳世一样，要劳动、社交、恋爱、婚嫁，但在那里他们已经上升成上流社会成员，成“报", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1541, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 23, "text": "光”（男贵族）、“亚囊”（女贵族），成天与“仙”、“拜”（佛）居住在一起，无忧无虑，长生不", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1601, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "光”（男贵族）、“亚囊”（女贵族），成天与“仙”、“拜”（佛）居住在一起，无忧无虑，长生不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1601, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 24, "text": "老，其乐融融。", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1665, "w": 249, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "老，其乐融融。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1665, "w": 249, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 25, "text": "如果是凶死者，布依族认为其灵魂堕入地狱受难，需举行“赎魂”仪式将其灵魂救赎", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1730, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "如果是凶死者，布依族认为其灵魂堕入地狱受难，需举行“赎魂”仪式将其灵魂救赎", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1730, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 26, "text": "出来，再超度进入“旁仙”、“旁拜”。否则其灵魂将永远陷在地狱受难，并作祟于阳世亲", "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1794, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "出来，再超度进入“旁仙”、“旁拜”。否则其灵魂将永远陷在地狱受难，并作祟于阳世亲", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 129, "y": 1794, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 27, "text": "人，使亲人家道不顺或总是生病。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1867, "w": 575, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "人，使亲人家道不顺或总是生病。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1867, "w": 575, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 28, "text": "布依族认为阳世与冥世之间有一座桥，叫“桥龙”。在生时孝敬父母尊重长辈有德行", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1927, "w": 1459, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族认为阳世与冥世之间有一座桥，叫“桥龙”。在生时孝敬父母尊重长辈有德行", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1927, "w": 1459, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 29, "text": "者，其灵魂上了桥后，桥面越走越宽，反之则越走越窄，以至窄如刀刃。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1996, "w": 1206, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "者，其灵魂上了桥后，桥面越走越宽，反之则越走越窄，以至窄如刀刃。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1996, "w": 1206, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 30, "text": "送葬时，布摩要根据每个人的“八字”推算出谁能送谁不能送，如果不能送者参加送", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 2052, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "送葬时，布摩要根据每个人的“八字”推算出谁能送谁不能送，如果不能送者参加送", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 2052, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 31, "text": "葬，会给自己带来厄运。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2124, "w": 414, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "葬，会给自己带来厄运。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2124, "w": 414, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 32, "text": "丧后，孝满脱服，守制三年，禁礼祭食。丧家在安葬死者七七四十九天后，要举行脱", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 2185, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "丧后，孝满脱服，守制三年，禁礼祭食。丧家在安葬死者七七四十九天后，要举行脱", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 2185, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 33, "text": "孝仪式。脱孝那天，所有家族集中孝家，统一将孝衣帕洗净。在孝家由布摩先生主持祭", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2249, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "孝仪式。脱孝那天，所有家族集中孝家，统一将孝衣帕洗净。在孝家由布摩先生主持祭", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2249, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 34, "text": "供死者，当晚合族共吃一顿饭，互道保重，依依而别。守制三年中，孝子禁吃鱼虾和菌子，", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2317, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "供死者，当晚合族共吃一顿饭，互道保重，依依而别。守制三年中，孝子禁吃鱼虾和菌子，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2317, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 35, "text": "不准吃鸡头，出门作客不准坐上席。孝家三年内不准嫁姑娘办喜事，等等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2382, "w": 1295, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不准吃鸡头，出门作客不准坐上席。孝家三年内不准嫁姑娘办喜事，等等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2382, "w": 1295, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 249, "line_no": 36, "text": "布依族丧葬期间和之后有一系列禁忌，如给死者穿衣服都穿单忌双，据说穿双会连", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 2450, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族丧葬期间和之后有一系列禁忌，如给死者穿衣服都穿单忌双，据说穿双会连", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 2450, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
